description:
Join Sudhir Ramachandran as he takes us through his journey as a photographer across changing times and technologies—from the analog era to the digital age and beyond. Explore the evolution of photography through his experiences, insights, and reflections on a constantly changing medium. The conversation will be led by Senthil Kumar Muruganandhan, a photographer who has worked closely with Sudhir over the years, offering an insider's perspective on this journey through photography and time.

&nbsp;

This event is in collaboration with Ananya Drishya.

&nbsp;
